# System Requirements Specification (SRS)
## Wilderness Weather Station

**Case study source:** Ian Sommerville, *Software Engineering*, 9th edition —
Ch. 1 §1.3.2 (pp. 19–21), Ch. 4 §4.1 (pp. 84–89), Ch. 7 §7.1 (pp. 188–198).

