## Traceability matrix (UR → SR)

| UR | System requirements |
|---|---|
| UR-01 | SR-01, SR-02, SR-03 |
| UR-02 | SR-04, SR-05, SR-06 |
| UR-03 | SR-06, SR-07, SR-08 |
| UR-04 | SR-09, SR-10 |
| UR-05 | SR-11 |
| UR-06 | SR-12 |
| UR-07 | SR-18, SR-19 |
| UR-08 | SR-13, SR-14 |
| UR-09 | SR-15 |
| UR-10 | SR-16 |
| UR-11 | SR-17, SR-18, SR-19, SR-29 |
| UR-12 | SR-20, SR-21, SR-23 |
| UR-13 | SR-22, SR-23 |
| UR-14 | SR-02, SR-23, SR-24, SR-25 |
| UR-15 | SR-26, SR-27 |
| UR-16 | SR-14, SR-28, SR-29, SR-30 |
| UR-17 | NSR-01 – NSR-04 (plus SR-08, SR-21, SR-27, SR-30) |
| UR-18 | NSR-05 – NSR-07 |

**Totals:** 30 functional system requirements, 17 non-functional system requirements.

## Development process per requirement group

| Group | Process branch |
|---|---|
| SR-01 – SR-08, SR-13 – SR-18, SR-20 – SR-23, SR-28 – SR-30 | Plan-driven ([`../software_process/plan_driven.md`](../software_process/plan_driven.md)) |
| SR-09 – SR-12, SR-19, SR-24, SR-25 | Agile ([`../software_process/agile.md`](../software_process/agile.md)) |
| SR-26, SR-27 | Dynamic component-based reconfiguration ([`../software_process/process_model.md`](../software_process/process_model.md)) |

